# Vitest test files live in api/ next to the handlers they test, but they
# have no default export (no HTTP handler) — they were never meant to be
# routes. Vercel doesn't know that on its own: every non-underscore .js file
# directly under api/ is treated as its own Serverless Function, so without
# this, each test file silently counted against the 12-function Hobby-plan
# cap and eventually pushed a normal-looking merge over the limit.
api/*.test.js
